  "paragraphs": [
    "Case 2",
    "",
    "Based on the following transactions for GTech inc. in its first month of operation in 2025, please show the details of T-accounts for the affected accounts. Determine the ending balance for each account. ",
    "",
    "Jan 1 - Owner invests $40,000 cash to start the business.",
    "Jan 2 - Paid $24,000 cash for a one-year office rent policy in advance.",
    "Jan 3 - Purchased office equipment for $8,000 cash.",
    "Jan 5 - Purchased office supplies for $1,500 on account.",
    "Jan 15 - Provided consulting services to a client for $9,000 cash.",
    "Jan 20 - Provided services to another client for $6,000 on account.",
    "Jan 22 - Paid $800 for a monthly utility bill.",
    "Jan 25 - Paid $1,000 cash to reduce the amount owed on office supplies.",
    "Jan 28 - The owner withdrew $2,000 cash for personal use.",
    "Jan 29 - Received $4,000 cash from the client billed on Jan 20.",
    "Jan 30 - Recorded one month of rent expense ($2,000) from the prepaid policy.",
    "Jan 31 - Recorded $1,100 of office supplies expense for the month.",
    "",
    "Transaction 1: Jan 1 - Owner invests $40,000 cash to start the business.​​",
    "",
    "​​Debit ​​Cash​​ $40,000",
    "Credit ​​Owner's Capital​​ $40,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 2: Jan 2 - Paid $24,000 cash for a one-year office rent policy in advance.​​",
    "Debit ​​Prepaid Rent​​ $24,000",
    "Credit ​​Cash​​ $24,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 3: Jan 3 - Purchased office equipment for $8,000 cash.​​",
    "Debit ​​Equipment​​ $8,000",
    "Credit ​​Cash​​ $8,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 4: Jan 5 - Purchased office supplies for $1,500 on account.​​",
    "Debit ​​Office Supplies​​ $1,500",
    "Credit ​​Accounts Payable​​ $1,500",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 5: Jan 15 - Provided consulting services to a client for $9,000 cash.​​",
    "​​Debit ​​Cash​​ $9,000",
    "Credit ​​Service Revenue​​ $9,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 6: Jan 20 - Provided services to another client for $6,000 on account.​​",
    "Debit ​​Accounts Receivable​​ $6,000",
    "Credit ​​Service Revenue​​ $6,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 7: Jan 22 - Paid $800 for a monthly utility bill.​​",
    "Debit ​​Utilities Expense​​ $800",
    "Credit ​​Cash​​ $800",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 8: Jan 25 - Paid $1,000 cash to reduce the amount owed on office supplies.​​",
    "Debit ​​Accounts Payable​​ $1,000",
    "Credit ​​Cash​​ $1,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 9: Jan 28 - The owner withdrew $2,000 cash for personal use.​​",
    "Debit ​​Owner's Withdraw​​ $2,000",
    "Credit ​​Cash​​ $2,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 10: Jan 29 - Received $4,000 cash from the client billed on Jan 20.​​",
    "Debit ​​Cash​​ $4,000",
    "Credit ​​Accounts Receivable​​ $4,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 11: Jan 30 - Recorded one month of rent expense from the prepaid policy.​​",
    "Debit ​​Rent Expense​​ $2,000",
    "Credit ​​Prepaid Rent​​ $2,000",
    "",
    "​​Transaction 12: Jan 31 - Recorded office supplies expense for the month.​​",
    "Debit ​​Supplies Expense​​ $1,100",
    "Credit ​​Office Supplies​​ $1,100",
